  27:     5. Generate a random motif pattern of 4-6 pixels within the 3x3 cell (bbox should span 3x3).
  28:     6. Stamp motif into all same-parity cells (clipping at truncated edges) to get the output.
  29:     7. Input = output with all motif pixels removed except those in the source cell.
